message: "If you use this edition, please cite it as below, and cite the 1903 source edition separately."
type: dataset
title: "DdT 1, Vol. 11 — Dietrich Buxtehude: Instrumental Works"
abstract: >-
  A corrected MEI 5.1 edition of volume 11 of the first series of Denkmäler
  deutscher Tonkunst (1903): Dietrich Buxtehude's fourteen sonatas Op. I and
  Op. II and three appendix works, edited by Carl Stiehl. Sixteen of the
  seventeen works are encoded as complete work-level files, each measure
  linked to the Bayerische Staatsbibliothek digital facsimile.
